    "name": "ipify IP Geolocation Account IP Address API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The ipify IP Geolocation API (geo.ipify.org) is the commercial counterpart to the free public IP API. It is operated by WhoisXML API and resolves an IPv4 or IPv6 address — or a domain or email — into a geolocation, ISP, Autonomous System (ASN), and reverse-DNS profile. Authentication uses an API key passed as the `apiKey` query parameter. Plans are credit-metered (Country = 1 credit, Country+City = 2, Country+City+VPN = 3).\n\nContact Support:\n Name: ipify Geolocation API",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
